<p><m>\mathbf{v}(1) =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/>.</p>
<p><m>\mathbf{a}(1) =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0003"/>.</p>
<p>The direction of motion is <var form="popup">
<li>
<p>Top-to-Bottom</p>
</li>
